{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the end of everything. Please gear up responsibly.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Out of Time</i> is a fast-paced, multi-player co-op roguelite where your squad, gear, and teamwork decide survival. Battle through a fractured world where past, present, and future collide - facing swarms of corrupted enemies, brutal bosses, and chaotic mini-games all before time runs out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gear-Defined Chaos</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/68c942aad9e3a860c000807a6d543d5d.poster.avif?t=1765389433\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/68c942aad9e3a860c000807a6d543d5d.webm?t=1765389433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Build your playstyle around dozens of unique weapons and gear sets, each unlocking totally unique abilities and mini-games. Combine DPS firepower, supportive heals and buffs, or a healthy dose of Tank to create your own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Tethered Teamwork</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/176d5356b827a3bfb3e172b3699cf012.poster.avif?t=1765389433\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/176d5356b827a3bfb3e172b3699cf012.webm?t=1765389433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Stay close or suffer the consequences. The Tether System rewards proximity with shared buffs, healing, and stats - but break away and you risk not only yourself, but your entire team. Collaboration isn\u2019t optional - it\u2019s the core of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Take on the Timelines</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/461c1e5249f8d2fe34d7626ce58ff19c.poster.avif?t=1765389433\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/461c1e5249f8d2fe34d7626ce58ff19c.webm?t=1765389433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Battle through collapsing eras where past, present, and future collide. Each run is wildly different thanks to dynamic, era-blending maps, escalating enemies, and absurd emergent events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Fast-Paced Mayhem Loops</i></strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/484a9b6a6c2faff6a932355f89bce1f2.poster.avif?t=1765389433\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/484a9b6a6c2faff6a932355f89bce1f2.webm?t=1765389433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re on the clock. Each tight, action-packed run is a chaotic sprint full of intense combat and ridiculous boss fights. Win or wipe, you\u2019ll be back faster - stronger, smarter, and more determined than ever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A World Beyond Time</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/3f37ce3d8c2745a3ac944bf951a0e78b.poster.avif?t=1765389433\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/3f37ce3d8c2745a3ac944bf951a0e78b.webm?t=1765389433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up with other players in Infinitopia, mankind\u2019s new bastion and an MMO-like hub, to flex gear, plan builds, and tackle seasonal content. Compete on leaderboards, unlock new eras, and evolve your arsenal in a universe where survival fuels progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You'll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D multiplayer roguelite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No locked roles: combine hundreds of gear pieces into millions of possible builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4-player co-op systems that reward teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience hundreds of over-the-top abilities - from transforming into a dragon to dropping airstrikes or deploying tesla towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free regular content updates, seasonal expansions, new modes and features such as PvP</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038140?t=1765389433","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038140?t=1765389433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/85bb687c92a25b7afff713c30a15b7196b54fe05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765389433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/85bb687c92a25b7afff713c30a15b7196b54fe05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765389433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the end of everything. Please gear up responsibly.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Out of Time</i> is a fast-paced, multi-player co-op roguelite where your squad, gear, and teamwork decide survival. Battle through a fractured world where past, present, and future collide - facing swarms of corrupted enemies, brutal bosses, and chaotic mini-games all before time runs out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gear-Defined Chaos</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/68c942aad9e3a860c000807a6d543d5d.poster.avif?t=1765389433\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/68c942aad9e3a860c000807a6d543d5d.webm?t=1765389433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Build your playstyle around dozens of unique weapons and gear sets, each unlocking totally unique abilities and mini-games. Combine DPS firepower, supportive heals and buffs, or a healthy dose of Tank to create your own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Tethered Teamwork</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/176d5356b827a3bfb3e172b3699cf012.poster.avif?t=1765389433\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/176d5356b827a3bfb3e172b369